# Stale in-place backups.
#
# Seven of these were committed, including two divergent copies of
# src/middleware.ts -- the file that enforces the dashboard auth boundary.
# _nfc-route-backup/ was worse than inert: tsconfig includes **/*.ts and
# excludes only node_modules, so both of its route files were type-checked on
# every production build while serving nobody. Git history is the backup.
*.backup
*.backup-*
*.before-*
_nfc-route-backup/
